<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended Dec 6, compared with the Nov 29 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.52 vs 5.30</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............4.92 vs 5.02</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.42 vs 5.42</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.30 vs 5.29</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.40 vs 5.38</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.39 vs 5.38</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.43 vs 6.41</p>
</text>
